WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.276 --> 00:00:04.693
(Abdel speaking in foreign language)

00:00:06.388 --> 00:00:09.600
(dramatic music)

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.670
- As the war in Gaza rages,

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:15.388
violence against Palestinians
in the West Bank is surging.

00:00:15.388 --> 00:00:17.580
(person shouting in foreign language)

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.290
According to Palestinian villagers,

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.940
Israeli settler attacks like these

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.040
have been happening almost daily.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.370
So right now, a group of
settlers have kind of moved up

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:29.100
to the road here to try
intimidate the Palestinian farmers

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.089
who live on this land.

00:00:30.089 --> 00:00:34.620
(people speaking in foreign language)

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.645
These guys are coming in
large groups with weapons.

00:00:37.645 --> 00:00:40.352
(people speaking in foreign language)

00:00:40.352 --> 00:00:44.852
(Abdel speaking in foreign language)

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:50.250
I'm in the town of Qusra in the West Bank.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.720
This is a Palestinian village

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:55.950
where six people were killed
in just a 24-hour period.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.240
The villagers we were talking to here

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.890
are saying that the attacks

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:02.400
and intimidation from settlers
has gone into overdrive.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.310
This is one of the bloodiest
periods in the West Bank

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:06.840
in 15 years.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:09.270
With so much attention focused on Gaza

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:10.950
and focused in the north of the country,

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:13.230
so many of the Palestinians
here are worried

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:15.452
that they will be next
in line to be attacked.

00:01:15.452 --> 00:01:17.730
(saw cutting)

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:19.766
At the height of the olive harvest season,

00:01:19.766 --> 00:01:23.343
Abdel Azeem Wadi works under
the watch of an IDF outpost.

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:27.190
His family has lived on this
land for three generations.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:32.010
On October 12th, Abdel was
with his brother Ibrahim

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:35.250
and nephew Ahmed, attending a
funeral for four Palestinians

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:37.100
who had been killed the previous day.

00:01:38.011 --> 00:01:43.011
(Abdel person speaking
in foreign language)

00:01:51.103 --> 00:01:53.305
(sirens ringing)

00:01:53.305 --> 00:01:58.305
(Abdel person speaking
in foreign language)

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.333
According to Abdel,

00:01:59.333 --> 00:02:01.770
who was just up the road
in the funeral procession,

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:04.500
this video shows armed
settlers stopping their car

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.003
and opening fire on Ibrahim and Ahmed.

00:02:07.003 --> 00:02:09.895
(gunshots firing)

00:02:09.895 --> 00:02:11.880
(camera person grunting)

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:14.343
Hours later, the two men
died at the hospital.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.390
Abdel says they were unarmed.

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.520
After the attack, settlers
have since claimed

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:23.223
they had been terrorists,
offering no evidence.

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:28.597
(Abdel speaking in foreign language)

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.660
During our interview, a group

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:38.523
of armed Israeli settlers approached.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:44.836
As the settlers walk
further and further forward,

00:02:44.836 --> 00:02:48.330
(dramatic music)

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.313
The Israeli military intervenes.

00:02:51.782 --> 00:02:56.040
(people speaking in foreign language)

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:57.930
The IDF has stepped in to kind

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:00.593
of pull the settlers back,
so there was no violence.

00:03:00.593 --> 00:03:02.880
But the Palestinian people
that we're with here,

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:05.780
the farmers are saying this
is happening almost every day.

00:03:06.946 --> 00:03:11.279
(Sara speaking in foreign language)

00:03:25.645 --> 00:03:28.395
(dramatic music)

00:03:32.008 --> 00:03:36.425
(Abdel speaking in foreign language)

00:03:48.106 --> 00:03:50.773
(pensive music)

